Z||000000||Ken Wittlief||06-29-2001||10:31 AM||||Someone suggested in another thread we should make our own version of the Fast and the Furious - expect:<P>  1. our movie will be about fieros and<BR>  2. we will shoot it with Hi8 Camcorders ala Blare Witch style.<P> So:<P>Scene one: Fiero Lisa is driving her GT with a friend, on the way to a car show though rural maryland, late at night. her friend is testing out his camcorder while she is driving along at 70mph on a two lane road.<P>  all of a sudden a noise comes from the engine compartment [sounds like two big rocks being banged together].<P>  FieroLisas eyes get as big as saucers and her jaw drops. She quickly scans the gauges and says inquisitively: "hello?!"<P>  she sees nothing wrong but still slows to 65mph.<P>  Again the 'rock noise' is heard from the engine compartment.<BR>  <BR>  Terrified now, FieroLisa turns to her passenger and screams:<P> "WHAT WAS THAT? WHAT THE H#LL WAS THAT?!!!"<p>[This message has been edited by Ken Wittlief (edited 06-29-2001).]||||reg||1
